# The community fortress: the turtle-and-counter meta, all pieces at once.
#
# The documented human answer to Impossible (wiki: ai-opponent-strategy,
# community guides, log 2026-07-31): fortify with turrets AND repair bays
# AND artillery behind, let the AI feed its 17-second-bound attack groups
# into a self-healing kill zone, counter-punch when a wave breaks. Our
# cover24 turtle lost WITHOUT repair -- turrets that are never healed are
# turrets bought twice. The pieces are a system, so this arm takes them
# together: cover on, AA roof on, a repair bay in the goals, artillery in
# the mix, waves at 25 for the counter.

name fortress
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery,repairbay
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 40
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 1
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 1
forward 0
scout 0
raid 3
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 1
kite 0
tech 0
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 0
medics 0
decoys 0
hp_floor 0
bunkers 0
flame 0
close 0
income_ladder 0
guns 0
nukes 0
